    "detailed_description": "Game Title: School Curse 3<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGenre: Horror<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA girl wakes up in a school one day. However, this is not her usual school, but a strange dimension filled with mysterious monsters. The girl must collect 10 magical books to escape this dimension.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis dimension was once a place where an evil power was sealed. However, the seal was broken, and the evil power has returned, causing the dimension to reappear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe girl must escape this dimension.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is played from a third-person perspective. The player controls the girl as she collects the magical books.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the girl is spotted by a monster, she will be attacked and the game will end.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game ends when the player collects 10 magical books. Once 10 books have been collected, the girl can escape the dimension.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player can avoid monster attacks by hiding in a moving locker.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a horror game set in a strange dimension filled with mysterious monsters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player can experience a thrilling escape game as they collect magical books.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is full of tension as the player avoids monster attacks and searches for magical books.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the third installment in the School Curse series, the game features connections to the previous games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTarget Audience:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll ages<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNumber of Players:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlaytime:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout 5 minutes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifficulty:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntermediate<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelease Date:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFebruary 2024",
